## 6. Termination

Your rights under this licence terminate automatically if you materially violate its terms.

If the violation can be cured, your rights will be reinstated if you stop and remedy the violation within 30 days after receiving written notice from the Licensor.

The Licensor may require an applicable commercial agreement for continued use where the violation involved Licensed Production Use, a Hosted Service, or another use requiring commercial permission.

Termination does not affect obligations, liabilities, or claims arising from conduct before termination.

Sections concerning intellectual property, contributions, warranty, liability, governing law, and prior violations survive termination.

